@startuml
title Bounded AI Research Investigation

actor User
participant "Investigation client\nReact panel / native AIInvestigationModel" as UI
participant "AI research routes" as API
participant "Investigation service\n(serial queue)" as Orchestrator
database "PostgreSQL\njobs, steps, passages" as DB
participant "Bounded typed tools\n(local data, documents,\noptional public research)" as Tools
participant "Configured Ollama" as Ollama

User -> UI: Select scope, depth, language,\nand research mode
UI -> API: POST /investigations\nroute "local" (strict request)
API -> Orchestrator: Strict typed request
Orchestrator -> DB: Persist queued job
API --> UI: Queued job id / state; orchestration continues locally
alt Material ambiguity
  Orchestrator -> DB: Persist waiting plan
  UI --> User: Request clarification and typed date scope
else Scope is sufficient
  opt Detailed mode
    Orchestrator -> Ollama: Candidate step identifiers
    Ollama --> Orchestrator: Prioritized identifiers
  end
  Orchestrator -> DB: Persist constrained plan
end
loop Each incomplete step
  Orchestrator -> Tools: Dispatch allowlisted tool with caps
  Tools --> Orchestrator: Evidence or explicit partial failure
  Orchestrator -> DB: Checkpoint step result
end

opt Detailed mode has failed local steps
  Orchestrator -> Ollama: Inspect partial evidence and failed local candidates
  Ollama --> Orchestrator: Select up to three retry identifiers
  Orchestrator -> Tools: One serial local retry pass
  Orchestrator -> DB: Checkpoint revised plan and retry results
end

Orchestrator -> Ollama: Selected evidence only
Ollama --> Orchestrator: Structured answer candidate
Orchestrator -> DB: Persist validated answer\nin checkpoint_json.providerResult
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator: Validate citations and answer schema
Orchestrator -> DB: Complete, partial, failed, or cancelled
loop Mounted pending job; manual 1.2-second interval
  UI -> API: GET /investigations/:id
  API -> DB: Read current persisted job and steps
  DB --> API: Snapshot / structured answer
  API --> UI: Status, facts, calculations, interpretations,\ngaps, conflicts, and evidence
end
UI --> User: Inspectable evidence-backed answer

note right of Orchestrator
One active job bounds CPU and RAM.
External checkpoints are never replayed by the retry loop.
Financial calculations use deterministic services.
Public web and provider research use separately authored
public queries and symbols only.
There is no cloud model route (ADR-229).
Restart validates the answer checkpoint without another model call.
Job deletion cascades to its steps.
end note

note over UI, API
  Native /ai-chat mode switches retain both workflows.
  Manual job polls can overlap slow reads; current snapshots retire older replies.
  Polling stops on completed, failed, cancelled, partial or waiting.
  Documents are mount-only reads; uploads keep original multipart file bytes.
  Real route exit clears local job/forms without deleting the backend job.
  macOS package and Demo parity review remain pending.
end note

@enduml
